{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>PanicLog – Anxiety Journal 是一款將所有紀錄留在手機本機的私密焦慮日記工具，適合剛經歷第一次恐慌發作、正在接受 CBT 治療、或在調整焦慮藥物期間需要追蹤發作頻率的人使用。原價 US $39.99 的終生版現正限時免費，內購限時免費期間可免費收下。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-179.webp\">\n<h2>本機儲存守護私密紀錄</h2>\n<p>PanicLog 讓用戶記錄每次恐慌發作的觸發因素、身體症狀、持續時間與嚴重程度，並可透過 CBT 思想紀錄挑戰災難化思考，逐步發現個人模式。所有日記、思想紀錄與洞察均以 SwiftData 儲存在本機，無需帳號、不設登入、不上傳雲端，亦不含第三方 SDK 或追蹤器，官方表示沒有伺服器。免費版每月可記錄 5 次發作，並附呼吸練習與 Face ID 鎖定。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-320-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-321-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-322-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-323-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-324-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-325-scaled.jpg\">\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>PanicLog – Anxiety Journal 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：PanicLog – Anxiety Journal</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T17:01:16.601008+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":514,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T16:40:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T04:57:35.033435+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T16:57:43.342849+00:00","content_hash":"027de9f5761610d465cf591b02901e183a9a1157e1e32504d00141d13f253148","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}